<p class="eyebrow">The Schools of India Summit 2027</p>
<h1 id="hero-title">Blueprint <em>2040</em><span>Designing Schools for<br>the Children of 2040</span>
</h1>
<div class="actions"><a class="button" href="https://www.tezticket.com/events/TSOIP/sub_events/397">Book Tickets </a><a class="text-link" href="#partnership">Become a Partner </a>
</div>
</div>
