<section class="wrap section about" id="about">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">THE QUESTION THAT BRINGS US TOGETHER</p>
<h2>What school does the<br>child of 2040 <em>need?</em>
</h2>
</div>
<div class="prose">
<p class="large">And how do we start building it now?</p>
<p>The Schools of India Summit brings together the people who build, lead and teach in Indian schools, alongside students, to examine what the child of 2040 will need and begin designing the schools that can make it possible.</p>
<p>One day. One defining question. A practical blueprint for what comes next.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="promise">
<div class="wrap promise-inner"><span class="star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">THE PROMISE TO EVERY PARTICIPATING SCHOOL</p>
<h2>Leave with a one-page <em>blueprint.</em> Start with your school.</h2>
<p>The day’s conversations turned into a practical blueprint for you to build the school the child of 2040 needs.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
