<section class="section restored-section" id="faqs">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="restored-heading faq-heading">
      <span class="section-tag">Assistance</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faqs-container" id="faqs-container">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">
          <span>When and where is the summit?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-1" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">The Schools of India Summit takes place on 10th January 2027 at The Westin, Koregaon Park, Pune. The day runs approximately 9:00 AM–9:00 PM; final programme timings may change.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">
          <span>Is this a residential event?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-2" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">No. This is a one-day, in-person, non-residential summit. Accommodation and travel are not included.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">
          <span>Who should attend?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-3" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">School founders, promoters, operators, directors, trustees, principals, academic leaders, teachers, policymakers, education thought leaders and organisations across the school ecosystem. Students from Grade 10 onwards are also welcome.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">
          <span>What does a ticket cost and include?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-4" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">A delegate pass is ₹5,000 + GST. A student pass is ₹2,000 + GST. Both passes include access to the daytime programme, workshops and networking, morning tea and snacks, lunch and high tea. Evening performances and the gala dinner are included with the Delegate Pass only.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">
          <span>Who is eligible for a student pass?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-5" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">Students in Grade 10 and above are eligible. Student verification may be required.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6">
          <span>Is there a group discount?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-6" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">Yes. Book five or more delegate passes for a 10% discount. There is no early-bird price. Use the booking assistance form for group enquiries.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-7">
          <span>Is the gala dinner included?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-7" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-7" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">Evening performances and the gala dinner are included with the Delegate Pass only.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-8">
          <span>Will a GST invoice be available?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-8" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-8" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">The GST invoice process is pending confirmation. Please check with the booking team before purchase if you need an invoice.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-9">
          <span>Can I transfer or refund my ticket?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-9" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-9" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">Tickets are non-transferable. Refund requests are considered case by case and are subject to management approval.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-10">
          <span>Where can I see the speakers and programme?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-10" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-10" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">Meet the speakers in the <a href="#speakers">Featured Speakers section</a> above. Use the Download Programme Schedule button below the profiles to view the programme. Speaker participation and programme timings may change.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 class="faq-question"><button class="faq-trigger" id="faq-question-11" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-11">
          <span>How can my organisation become a partner?</span><span class="faq-icon-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </button></h3>
        <div class="faq-panel" id="faq-answer-11" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-11" inert>
          <div class="faq-content"><p class="faq-answer">Complete the partner enquiry form on this page. The TSOI team will follow up about partnership opportunities.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
